{"quest_id": 4281, "name": "空からの襲来", "description": "空を飛ぶ魔物が村々を\n襲っているとの報せを受けた。\n被害が拡大する前に討伐せよ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "空を断つ必殺剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920042, "map_no": 3894, "level": 95, "multiplier": 0.95, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 608, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_count": 1, "hp": 608, "attack": 133, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 20}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 950, "attack": 142, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 56}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "ここ数日、城下の村々が相次いで空を飛ぶ\n魔物に襲われているという報告があります。", "face": "l56bb55a8b0e9"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうやら空飛ぶ魔物たちが活性化しているようです。\n被害の拡大を防ぐため、この森で迎え撃ちましょう！", "face": "l56bb55a8b0e9"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！　飛行する魔物の群れの行き先が判明。\n恐らくそこに兵力を集めていると思われます。", "face": "l60303f9a5488"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "戦力が集まる前に撃退した方が良さそうですね。", "face": "l56bb55a8b0e9"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、魔物たちを追いましょう！", "face": "l56bb55a8b0e9"}]}], "active": true}